  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 91036662a85844eb162bdfbe2ea8ce9c, type: 3}
  m_Name: CanadianRules
  m_EditorClassIdentifier:
  displayName: Canadian
  description: 12x12 draughts - flying kings, men capture backward, mandatory maximum capture, on the biggest board in the game.
  longDescription: "<b><color=#D4AF37>Goal:</color></b>\nCapture all of your opponent's pieces, or leave them with no legal move to make.\n\n<b><color=#D4AF37>Board:</color></b>\nThe biggest board in the game - 12x12, with each player starting 30 pieces on the first five rows on their side, leaving the middle two rows empty. White always moves first.\n\n<b><color=#D4AF37>Movement:</color></b>\nMen move diagonally forward only. Kings are flying kings - they slide and capture any distance along a diagonal.\n\n<b><color=#D4AF37>Capturing:</color></b>\nCapturing is mandatory, and men may capture in any diagonal direction, including backward. If more than one path is available, you must play the one that captures the most pieces.\n\n<b><color=#D4AF37>No-Removal:</color></b>\nA captured piece stays on the board - still blocking its square - until your turn ends; you can't jump the same piece twice.\n\n<b><color=#D4AF37>Kings:</color></b>\nA piece only crowns if it finishes its turn on the back row - jumping through mid-capture and landing elsewhere leaves it a man.\n\n<b><color=#D4AF37>Win:</color></b>\nCapture every enemy piece, or leave your opponent with no legal move.\n\n<b><color=#D4AF37>Draw:</color></b>\nEither player may offer a draw at any time; if accepted, the match ends level. The match is also drawn if the same position, with the same side to move, repeats three times, or if material is reduced to 3 Kings vs 1 King for 16 further moves, or 2 Kings (or a King and a man) vs 1 King for 5 further moves, without a result."
  rows: 12
  columns: 12
  pieceRowsPerSide: 5
  movementScheme: 0
  piecesOnAllSquares: 0
  leaveBackRowEmpty: 0
  flyingKings: 1
  menCaptureBackward: 1
  menCannotCaptureKings: 0
  mustCaptureMaximum: 1
  preferKingMover: 0
  preferKingCaptures: 0
  preferEarlierKingCapture: 0
  midChainPromotionRule: 0
  deferCaptureRemoval: 1
  forbidImmediateReversal: 0
  noProgressMoveLimit: 0
  singleManLosesToKing: 0
  firstMoveColor: 1
  threefoldRepetitionEnabled: 1
  threeVsOneKingDrawLimit: 16
  twoVsOneKingDrawLimit: 5
  oneVsOneIsDraw: 0
